## 📂 Project Structure

```
Passive-Image-Forgery-Detection-College-Major-Project/
├── backend/              # Inference API + model serving logic
├── frontend/             # Web app (upload UI, result visualization)
├── paper/                # Reference research paper(s)
├── samples/              # Sample CASIA test images for demo
├── dataset_setup.py      # Prepares CASIA dataset for training
├── download_dataset.py   # Fetches the CASIA v1.0 dataset
├── download_model.py     # Downloads pre-trained model weights
├── kaggle_train.py       # Training script (Kaggle-ready)
├── vercel.json           # Deployment config
└── .gitignore
```

