## ❓ FAQ

<details>
<summary><b>What image formats are supported?</b></summary>
<br/>
Standard formats — JPG, PNG. (Update this once confirmed against the backend's actual validation logic.)
</details>

<details>
<summary><b>Does this detect AI-generated images?</b></summary>
<br/>
No — this pipeline is built specifically for copy-move and splicing forgery detection on real photographs, not for detecting GAN/diffusion-generated content.
</details>

